{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3791730/extras/wishlist.gif?t=1750251623\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3791730/extras/it_features.png?t=1750251623\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3791730/extras/captivating.png?t=1750251623\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Walk in the shoes of Detective Hindsight to explore Sin City and its residents. Who knows what anyone\u2019s hiding behind the scenes?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3791730/extras/walking_gif.gif?t=1750251623\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3791730/extras/investigation.png?t=1750251623\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Solve intriguing cases to sink your investigative teeth into. Analyze various scenes in their different stages at your own pace, using logic to unfurl the mysteries within. Highlight, scribble, and drag clues to deduce what really happened.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3791730/extras/investigation_gif.gif?t=1750251623\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3791730/extras/cast.png?t=1750251623\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\